units metal
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
read_data DATA
mass 1 26.9815
mass 2 6.94
variable lambda equal 1.0
variable mlambda equal 1.0-v_lambda
pair_style hybrid/scaled v_lambda deepmd MODEL v_mlambda ufm 7.5
pair_coeff * * deepmd Al Li
pair_coeff * * ufm 0.1 1.5
thermo_style custom step temp pe press
run 0
variable lambda equal 0.5
run 0
